<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank crown/dollar fix at 31.570 (31.434).</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank crown/dollar fix at 31.570 (31.434).</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) fixed the crown at 31.570 to the dollar after Friday's fixing at 31.434 and at 20.355 to the mark from 20.413.</p>
<p>The crown fixing is announced daily at about 1140 CET (1040 GMT) and is within plus/minus 5.0 percent of a dollar/mark basket midpoint calculated at 11:30:00 CET.</p>
<p>The above rates imply a deviation from the midpoint of -0.84 percent, the same as on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
